<%# locals: (href:, date:, description:, amount:, budget:, counterpart: nil, notes: nil, with_year: false, leading: nil, checkbox: nil) %>
<%# One record in a list, such as a Deposit: its date, its description with any notes as a muted second line under it, and its amount. A record between two envelopes also says where the money went or came from, such as "To Groceries", in a muted line of its own under the description. The whole row links to the record's edit page, or isn't a link when `href` is nil, for a record that's only read, such as a bank transaction. Put rows in components/record_list. The description is the second column, which daisyUI's list lets grow. %>
<%# The date is the month and day, which is enough in a list of one month. A list that goes back further passes `with_year`, which spells it out. %>
<%# The block, if there is one, is more under the description, such as a state and what can be done to the row. It can't have a link of its own when `href` is given, so it's for rows that aren't links. %>
<%# `leading` is a control to put before the date, such as a checkbox for choosing the row: the row is then a label for it, so the whole row is what's ticked. It's for a row that isn't a link. %>
<%# `checkbox` is a control for choosing the row that's wanted in a row that is a link, or has links and buttons in it, so it can't be a label for the whole row: it's in a cell of its own at the start of the row, outside the link, and its label is that cell, which is 3rem wide and as tall as the row, so it's a tap target of its own. Clicking the rest of the row still opens it. Give it an accessible name (`aria-label`). %>
<% row = capture do %>
  <%= leading %>
  <%# A fixed width, so descriptions line up whichever dates the rows have. %>
  <span class="<%= with_year ? "w-24" : "w-12" %> tabular-nums text-base-content/70"><%= with_year ? spelled_date(date) : date.strftime("%b %-d") %></span>
  <span class="list-col-grow">
    <span class="block"><%= description %></span>
    <% if counterpart.present? %>
      <span class="block text-base-content/70"><%= counterpart %></span>
    <% end %>
    <% if notes.present? %>
      <span class="block whitespace-pre-line text-base-content/70"><%= notes %></span>
    <% end %>
    <%= yield %>
  </span>
  <span class="text-right tabular-nums"><%= render "components/money", amount: amount, budget: budget %></span>
<% end %>
<% room = "gap-3 pl-12" if checkbox %>
<%= tag.li class: class_names("relative rounded-box hover:bg-base-200": checkbox).presence do %>
  <% if checkbox %>
    <label class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 z-10 flex w-12 select-none cursor-pointer items-start justify-center pt-4"><%= checkbox %></label>
  <% end %>
  <% if href %>
    <%= link_to href, class: class_names("list-row items-baseline", room, "hover:bg-base-200": !checkbox) do %><%= row %><% end %>
  <% elsif leading %>
    <label class="list-row cursor-pointer items-baseline hover:bg-base-200"><%= row %></label>
  <% else %>
    <div class="<%= class_names("list-row items-baseline", room) %>"><%= row %></div>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
